          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What similarities and differences did you find among the plants that you observed?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.13,
            0.885,
            0.171
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You must have observed that plants have a variety of features such as—"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
