            0.273,
            0.883,
            0.374
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, create a list of animals you observed during this walk or from your previous experiences. Record the places where they live, the food they eat and the way they move around in Table 2.2. Some examples have been provided for you."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.41,
            0.877,
            0.682
          ],
          "content": [
